WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.568 --> 00:00:15.972
Dr. stared at Wukong.

2
00:00:15.992 --> 00:00:18.693
"You're a monkey?"

3
00:00:20.093 --> 00:00:22.434
Roxy, Cozlin, and Wukong were back on Groon.

4
00:00:23.754 --> 00:00:25.254
Wukong puffed out his chest.

5
00:00:25.274 --> 00:00:30.416
"I'm not just a monkey—I'm Sun Wukong, the Monkey King!

6
00:00:32.196 --> 00:00:34.577
I once defeated Heaven's entire army!"

7
00:00:34.597 --> 00:00:38.378
"Fascinating," Dr.

8
00:00:38.458 --> 00:00:38.938
Odd said.

9
00:00:38.958 --> 00:00:43.259
"But can you make yourself tiny like Rocket Girl said?

10
00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:45.580
That's what we need you to do."

11
00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:48.421
"I do that all the time!"

12
00:00:48.741 --> 00:00:49.641
Wukong said.

13
00:00:49.661 --> 00:00:51.162
"Watch this!"

14
00:00:53.002 --> 00:00:55.603
He muttered a spell and became the size of a fly.

15
00:00:57.163 --> 00:00:58.184
He zipped into Dr.

16
00:00:58.264 --> 00:00:58.984
Odd's ear.

17
00:01:01.052 --> 00:01:02.513
"Hey! Get out of there!"

18
00:01:04.135 --> 00:01:08.278
Roxy and Cozlin giggled.

19
00:01:08.298 --> 00:01:09.578
"Funny, him!"

20
00:01:09.939 --> 00:01:10.579
Bippo said.

21
00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:14.562
Wukong flew back out and returned to his normal size.

22
00:01:15.843 --> 00:01:17.064
Dr. Odd frowned at him.

23
00:01:18.285 --> 00:01:19.426
Then he explained the mission.

24
00:01:19.446 --> 00:01:24.409
"You must go inside Meltron and destroy the controller."

25
00:01:25.610 --> 00:01:26.671
He described the controller.

26
00:01:30.184 --> 00:01:30.985
Wukong nodded.

27
00:01:31.005 --> 00:01:32.766
"I'm ready.

28
00:01:33.006 --> 00:01:33.446
Let's go!"

29
00:01:35.608 --> 00:01:38.310
Soon they were all walking toward the underground entrance.

30
00:01:38.330 --> 00:01:43.593
"That was a neat trick, Wukong," Cozlin said.

31
00:01:43.613 --> 00:01:48.217
"I can do cool stuff too—like walk through walls."

32
00:01:49.638 --> 00:01:50.598
Wukong shrugged.

33
00:01:50.618 --> 00:01:53.000
"I could probably do that."

34
00:01:53.020 --> 00:01:55.782
"How about this?"

35
00:01:56.682 --> 00:01:58.584
Cozlin held up her hand and shot a laser.

36
00:01:59.808 --> 00:02:03.130
Ka-boom! The hull of an old spaceship exploded.

37
00:02:03.150 --> 00:02:05.651
"Not bad."

38
00:02:06.752 --> 00:02:08.413
Wukong pulled out his iron bar.

39
00:02:08.433 --> 00:02:10.714
"This was a treasure from Heaven.

40
00:02:11.755 --> 00:02:13.235
I got it from a Dragon King."

41
00:02:14.516 --> 00:02:15.437
He swung it around.

42
00:02:18.558 --> 00:02:20.539
Bam! The bar hit Dr.

43
00:02:20.639 --> 00:02:21.160
Odd's leg.

44
00:02:23.601 --> 00:02:25.422
"Ouch!" Dr.

45
00:02:25.562 --> 00:02:26.623
Odd fell to the ground.

46
00:02:28.003 --> 00:02:29.104
Wukong bit his lip.

47
00:02:30.236 --> 00:02:31.877
He quickly put the iron bar away.

48
00:02:33.859 --> 00:02:35.360
Roxy glared at Wukong.

49
00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:39.222
"You need to learn how to be more careful!"

50
00:02:41.003 --> 00:02:41.924
Roxy carried Dr.

51
00:02:42.024 --> 00:02:44.846
Odd back to his moon as Cozlin and Wukong followed.

52
00:02:47.548 --> 00:02:50.910
Dr. Odd directed Roxy to a white room with medical equipment.

53
00:02:52.311 --> 00:02:53.552
"This is my hospital."

54
00:02:56.234 --> 00:02:57.354
A robot helped Dr.

55
00:02:57.494 --> 00:02:59.576
Odd onto a table and then scanned his leg.

56
00:03:02.572 --> 00:03:03.592
The robot sighed.

57
00:03:03.613 --> 00:03:07.174
"I'm afraid it's broken."

58
00:03:09.355 --> 00:03:10.755
Later everyone sat in Dr.

59
00:03:10.836 --> 00:03:11.656
Odd's computer room.

60
00:03:12.776 --> 00:03:13.977
His leg was in a cast.

61
00:03:16.478 --> 00:03:17.858
Wukong stared at the floor.

62
00:03:17.878 --> 00:03:20.540
"I'm really sorry."

63
00:03:23.241 --> 00:03:24.201
Dr. Odd shrugged.

64
00:03:24.221 --> 00:03:26.822
"I've made mistakes too.

65
00:03:27.663 --> 00:03:30.744
My medical robot said this should heal in a few weeks.

66
00:03:32.276 --> 00:03:33.757
It's not the end of the world."

67
00:03:34.878 --> 00:03:35.998
But Roxy was worried.

68
00:03:36.018 --> 00:03:39.720
"We need you to turn off that energy shield, Dr.

69
00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:42.882
Odd. Otherwise we can't stop Meltron!"

70
00:03:42.902 --> 00:03:47.525
"One of us can do it instead," Cozlin said.

71
00:03:48.525 --> 00:03:49.426
Roxy shook her head.

72
00:03:49.446 --> 00:03:52.167
"You and I have to fight the robots.

73
00:03:52.427 --> 00:03:55.369
Besides She shot a look at Wukong.

74
00:03:56.830 --> 00:03:59.652
"Somebody has a habit of causing trouble.

75
00:04:00.608 --> 00:04:03.591
We need to make sure he finds Meltron and gets the job done."

76
00:04:05.452 --> 00:04:06.353
Dr. Odd nodded.

77
00:04:06.373 --> 00:04:08.995
"I might know someone!"

78
00:04:09.996 --> 00:04:11.497
Cozlin hurried out of the room.

79
00:04:15.180 --> 00:04:17.101
really have changed, Dr.

80
00:04:17.321 --> 00:04:18.522
Odd," Roxy said.

81
00:04:19.964 --> 00:04:20.964
Dr. Odd chuckled.

82
00:04:20.984 --> 00:04:25.348
"I used to get angry at people all the time.

83
00:04:26.668 --> 00:04:28.129
But then you caught me, Mr.

84
00:04:28.209 --> 00:04:29.190
Presto, and Mrs.

85
00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:30.852
Wiggles and brought us to prison.

86
00:04:32.293 --> 00:04:35.195
I changed after reading a good self-help book there.

87
00:04:36.396 --> 00:04:37.957
It taught me to be a better person."

88
00:04:42.121 --> 00:04:44.102
Cozlin came back into the room, frowning.

89
00:04:44.122 --> 00:04:47.545
"I reached out to everyone I know.

90
00:04:48.526 --> 00:04:52.049
Meltron's robots have taken over even more planets now.

91
00:04:53.650 --> 00:04:55.812
Nobody can come to help us!"
